>>How do I increase my carying capacity (ignore bags of hoding).  My strength is
>>18/15 and I can only carry by bare essentials.  My gauntltes of power increase
>>my strength to 25, but I can't carry any more.
>
>You must have the HARD option set in your version.  Without bags of
>holding, you won't be able to carry any more.  Perhaps you should
>modify your idea of 'the bare essentials.'

With the hard option on, the carrying capacity also depends on your
experience level.  If you are not yet level 16, increasing your
level might help.  From the spoilers:

[with the hard option on]

| Strength | Capacity                                                       |
|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| 1-18     | 5*level + 5*str - 10*(wounded legs)                            |
| 18/01-25 | 5*level(up to level 16) + 40 - 10*(wounded legs)               |

Hmmm... This is the first time I've looked closely at this.  It 
doesn't quite look right to me.  (It looks like your carrying 
capacity might decrease as strength increases from 18 to 18/01).
Nevertheless, increasing your level might help.

